TITLE 100C pure water pH 3 equilibrium with minerals

SOLUTION 1
    temp    100
    pH      3.0
    units   mol/L
    water   1.0

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica        0.0  10.0
    Kaolinite     0.0  10.0
    Dolomite      0.0  10.0
    Epsomite      0.0  10.0
    Fe(OH)3(a)    0.0  10.0
    Halite        0.0  10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   fe_output.sel
    -reset  false
    -totals Fe(2) Fe(3)
    -molalities Fe+2 FeSO4 FeHCO3+ FeOH+ Fe+3 Fe(OH)2+ Fe(OH)3 FeSO4+ Fe2(OH)2+4 FeHSO4+2 Fe(SO4)2-

END
